  "question": {
    "text": "29.5 mg of organic compound containing nitrogen was digested according to Kjeldahl's method and the evolved ammonia was absorbed in 20mL of 0.1 M HCl solution. The excess of the acid required 15mL of 0.1M NaOH solution for complete neutralisation. The percentage of nitrogen in the compound is",
